FactoryOS public deployment: the umarell servers listen on loopback unless told otherwise.

Applied by deploy/fetch-umarell.sh to the chat tree (/var/lib/factoryos/umarell) only, after the cell planner's
patches_08d5a39 series, with patch -p1 --forward --batch. Written against umarell 08d5a39
(08d5a390a498cef123cfe36becfc45ee61876cd9, deploy/umarell.pin's commit) with the cell planner's
docs/upstream/patches_08d5a39/series.txt (factoryos-cell-planner 78b496c) applied.

The planner MCP the backend starts natively (agents/trajectory/mcp_server.py, :8890) bound 0.0.0.0: anything that
reached the instance's network could plan and read plans through an endpoint without authentication. Every
hard-coded 0.0.0.0 server bind of the tree is now an environment variable, default 127.0.0.1:
  TRAJ_MCP_HOST       agents/trajectory/mcp_server.py      (:8890, TRAJ_MCP_PORT)
  CELL_MCP_HOST       agents/cell/mcp_server.py            (:8892, CELL_MCP_PORT)
  CELL_HTTP_HOST      agents/cell/server.py                (:8891, CELL_HTTP_PORT)
  ORCHESTRATOR_BIND   agents/orchestrator/server.py        (:8889; ORCHESTRATOR_HOST is the address clients dial)
  ORCH_MCP_HOST       agents/orchestrator/cell_data_mcp.py (:8893, ORCH_MCP_PORT)
  POLICY_TRAINER_BIND agents/policy_trainer/mcp_server.py  (:8894; was env-driven already, default 0.0.0.0)
  DASHBOARD_HOST      dashboard/web_control_panel.py       (:8888)
The public host runs no Docker (provision.sh refuses it), so nothing sets them there. Upstream, the compose services
set them to 0.0.0.0 (see the upstream PR); this patch goes when sample-umarell has that change and the pin moves.

